#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example was provided in older versions to show how to switch roads using VS Events. It has been modified to use flat roads. Because they are flat, the tire/ground contect does not change with location.
#
#A single flat road (ID = 999) is used three times to automatically generate visual information for the video. Two reference paths are defined, and are used for traffic vehicles.
#
#VS Events to change the target used by the driver model from one path to the other, and to change speed.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

